   132	## Derived on paper
   133	
   134	For a singleton `A={i}`, using its stored default and stored singleton outcome,
   135	
   136	`Psi_{ {i} } = Delta F({i}) - d_i = [F(a_i)-F(a^0)] - [F(a_i)-F(a^0)] = 0`.
